\caption{Registered verdict of the first test (unchanged), on \evone{40} fresh seeds at $\beta = \evone{0.05}$ and the median position. Bounds are one-sided: \evone{95}\% for the rule clause and the absolute part, \evone{98.75}\% for the comparisons. The amended pass also requires the H2 rule clause and admission of the comparison bounds, whose interval procedures were admitted on development distributions with B3 as proxy; nominal coverage for the selected R3 is not established.}\label{tab:verdict1}
